 heading('5.4 Vector Differentiation'),paragraph('Several rules for computing derivatives of vector functions are listed below, which can be proved by applying rules for limits of vector functions to appropriate theorems for scalar derivatives.'),heading('Remember'),paragraph('A vector F⃗ also written as F.'),heading('5.4.1 Formula of differentiation'),
